DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART:20261002T115900Z
DTEND:20261002T125900Z
SUMMARY:AAMAS 2027 · Main-track abstract registration deadline
DESCRIPTION:International Conference on Autonomous Agents and Multiagent Sy
 stems\nMeeting: 2027-05-03 to 2027-05-07\, Hanoi\, Vietnam\nStatus: confi
 rmed\, checked 2026-10-30\nFormat: Paper-based / Blue Sky Ideas short pap
 ers\nOfficial source: https://warwick.ac.uk/fac/sci/dcs/aamas2027/calls/c
 all-for-main-track/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#
 aamas-2027\nNotes: Annual flagship meeting in Hanoi. New main-track submi
 ssions are closed because the Oct 1 abstract gate has passed. The separat
 e four-page Blue Sky Ideas track is open: its OpenReview form (opened Oct
  20) was observed live on 2026-10-30\, and its Nov 5 gate only controls t
 he Nov 12 short papers. A Demonstrations call posted Oct 27 (four-page pa
 per plus video\, in the proceedings\, due Dec 27 AoE) is not tracked as a
  separate route. The AAAI fast track is limited to highly rated AAAI-27 p
 apers and is not a general new-paper route. Size XL is an editorial estim
 ate. Historical acceptance covers main full papers only\, not Blue Sky Id
 eas or the newly introduced 2027 Findings track.
CATEGORIES:Machine Learning,Reinforcement Learning,Autonomous Agents & Mult
 iagent Systems,Human-AI Interaction & Deployment
URL:https://warwick.ac.uk/fac/sci/dcs/aamas2027/calls/call-for-main-track/
END:VEVENT
