 /gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#aiih-2027\nNotes: Official AIiH pages (ch
 ecked 2026-10-29) list the fourth edition at the Mathematical Institute\,
  University of Oxford\, Sep 1-3\, 2027\; the format is not stated. Deadli
 nes are published as 11.59PM Pacific Time (GMT-8)\; the January proposal 
 row keeps -08:00\, while rows falling in PDT (Apr 9\, Jun 11\, Jul 2) sto
 re the earlier GMT-7 instant per their cutoff notes\, and the date-only n
 otification keeps -08:00. Full papers are double-blind via CMT (2026 pape
 rs appeared in Springer LNCS)\; abstracts and STARS surveys are archived 
 on Zenodo. Size is an editorial estimate.
