  and PhD symposium forms are set to close Nov 15\, 21:00 UTC. The Web4Goo
 d track is discontinued. Research must substantively address the Web\, no
 t merely use a web dataset. Preserve WWW as the stable series alias. Size
  is an editorial estimate.
